<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>OG Cartoon Network <3 | Official Hub</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0b132b;
            --bg-card: #1c2541;
            --neon-blue: #4eb1ff;
            --accent-blue: #3a7cd6;
            --text-main: #ffffff;
            --text-dim: #a0b2d8;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        /* --- Navigation --- */
        nav {
            background: rgba(11, 19, 43, 0.95);
            padding: 20px 10%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: fixed;
            width: 80%;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--bg-card);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--neon-blue);
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-blue);
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-main);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 30px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--neon-blue);
        }

        /* --- Hero Section --- */
        header {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, #1c2541 0%, #0b132b 100%);
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        /* --- Sections --- */
        section {
            padding: 100px 15%;
            min-height: 60vh;
        }

        .about-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 50px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-blue);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(58, 124, 214, 0.2);
        }

        h2 {
            color: var(--neon-blue);
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* --- Join Button --- */
        .cta-btn {
            background: var(--accent-blue);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--accent-blue);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .cta-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            background: var(--neon-blue);
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--neon-blue);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--bg-card);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">OG CN <3</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#join">Join Us</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header id="home">
        <h1>Nostalgia Never Sleeps</h1>
        <p>The ultimate hub for classic animation fans. Relive the golden era of Cartoon Network and Adult Swim in a chill, 18+ community.</p>
        <a href="#join" class="cta-btn">Enter the Hub</a>
    </header>

    <section id="about">
        <div class="about-grid">
            <div>
                <h2>The Community</h2>
                <p>We are dedicated to preserving the vibes of the 90s and early 2000s. From weekly watch parties to retro gaming nights, our server is a sanctuary for those who remember the good old days of Saturday morning cartoons.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Server Perks</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>18+ Stoner-Friendly Space</li>
                    <li>Custom "Cartoon Botwork" Features</li>
                    <li>Exclusive Watch Party Streams</li>
                    <li>Nostalgia-Fueled Discussions</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="join" style="text-align: center;">
        <h2>Ready to Tune In?</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 40px;">Grab your favorite snacks and join thousands of other fans in the official Discord.</p>
        <div style="margin: auto; max-width: 400px;">
            <a href="https://discord.gg/BpunqM7CbT" target="_blank" class="cta-btn">JOIN VIA DISCORD</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 OG Cartoon Network <3 Community. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
